<section class="w-full px-[var(--page-px)] light bg-primary text-on-primary py-[var(--band-py)]" data-slot="section"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-[26px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 md:gap-4"><span class="hidden md:block"><p class="font-medium text-[10px] md:text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.15em] md:tracking-[0.16em] text-on-primary opacity-80" data-slot="eyebrow">LAST THING</p></span><h2 class="font-display [font-weight:700] max-w-[54rem] tracking-[-0.005em] leading-[1.16] md:leading-[1.14] text-[calc(1.5625rem*var(--display-scale))] md:text-[calc(2.625rem*var(--display-scale))]" data-slot="display">It is not going to fix itself.</h2><p class="text-[14.5px] md:text-[19px] leading-[1.55] opacity-[0.78]"><span class="md:hidden">Get the flat price. Do not like the number? You lost ninety seconds.</span><span class="hidden md:inline">Get the flat price. If you do not like the number you have lost ninety seconds and paid nothing at all.</span></p></div><div class="hidden md:block"><form method="post" action="/quote" class="flex w-full flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:items-center"><select class="h-auto rounded-[var(--control-radius)] bg-card px-4 py-[15px] text-[16px] md:text-[16px] shadow-none" name="job" required=true><option value="blocked_drain">Blocked drain</option><option value="burst_pipe">Burst or leaking pipe</option><option value="hot_water">Hot water</option><option value="tap_toilet">Tap, toilet or cistern</option><option value="sewer_line">Sewer line</option><option value="leak_detection">Leak detection</option><option value="repipe">Whole-house repipe</option><option value="fit_out">Bathroom or kitchen fit-out</option><option value="other">Something else</option></select><input type="text" class="file:text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft selection:bg-primary selection:text-on-primary border-input w-full min-w-0 border transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-accent-error/20 aria-invalid:border-accent-error h-auto rounded-[var(--control-radius)] bg-card px-4 py-[15px] text-[16px] md:text-[16px] shadow-none" data-slot="input" name="zip" required=true placeholder="ZIP code" value=""/><input type="tel" class="file:text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft selection:bg-primary selection:text-on-primary border-input w-full min-w-0 border transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-accent-error/20 aria-invalid:border-accent-error h-auto rounded-[var(--control-radius)] bg-card px-4 py-[15px] text-[16px] md:text-[16px] shadow-none" data-slot="input" name="mobile" required=true placeholder="Mobile number" value=""/><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[var(--control-radius)] transition-all cursor-pointer disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&#38;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&#38;_svg:not([class*=&#39;size-&#39;])]:size-4 [&#38;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-accent-error/20 aria-invalid:border-accent-error hover:bg-primary/90 px-[var(--control-px)] py-[var(--control-py)] text-[length:var(--control-text)] dark shrink-0 bg-background text-ink [font-weight:600]" data-slot="button" type="submit">Send me my price  →</button></form></div><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[var(--control-radius)] transition-all cursor-pointer disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&#38;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&#38;_svg:not([class*=&#39;size-&#39;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&#38;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-accent-error/20 aria-invalid:border-accent-error hover:bg-primary/90 px-[var(--control-px)] py-[var(--control-py)] text-[length:var(--control-text)] dark md:hidden w-full bg-background text-ink [font-weight:600]" data-slot="button" href="tel:+15035550148">Call (503) 555-0148</a><p class="hidden md:block text-[16px] font-medium opacity-80">Or call (503) 555-0148 — 24 hours, answered by a human in Portland. Average pickup: 11 seconds.</p></div></section>
